abstract: >-
  A zero-Mathlib Lean 4.35.0 formalization (14 unconditional theorems verified across
  six kernel checks and five independent implementations), exact-arithmetic and
  SAT-certified falsification bench, and AMS-LaTeX white paper auditing classical
  complexity barriers and twelve divergent pathways toward P vs. NP. P vs. NP remains
  open; no proof of P = NP or P != NP is claimed.
